---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy — Lead Answered"
  description="Lead Answered privacy policy, including SMS/text messaging terms and how we handle your information."
>
  <Nav />
  <main class="max-w-[760px] mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="section-h text-[32px] md:text-[40px] text-ink-900 mb-1.5">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <p class="text-[14px] text-ink-400 mb-8">Last updated: June 11, 2026</p>

    <div
      class="prose prose-slate max-w-none prose-headings:font-semibold prose-headings:tracking-tight prose-headings:text-ink-900 prose-a:text-brand-600 prose-a:font-medium prose-a:no-underline hover:prose-a:underline prose-strong:text-ink-900 prose-li:my-1"
    >
      <p>
        Lead Answered (“<strong>Lead Answered</strong>,” “we,” “us,” or “our”) is
        a lead-response service operated by <strong>Grovebox LLC</strong>. We act
        on behalf of the businesses (“Contractors”) that use our service to
        respond to people who contact them. This Privacy Policy explains what
        information we collect, how we use it, and your choices — with particular
        attention to SMS/text messaging.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you submit a contact or quote-request form on a Contractor’s
        website, we receive the information you provide, which typically
        includes:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your name</li>
        <li>Your mobile phone number</li>
        <li>Details about the project or service you’re requesting</li>
        <li>
          Any other information you include in the form or in your text
          conversation with us
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We also keep a record of the SMS messages exchanged so we can assist you
        and the Contractor.
      </p>

      <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use your information to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Text you back on behalf of the Contractor about your request</li>
        <li>Ask questions to understand and qualify your request</li>
        <li>Propose and confirm appointment times</li>
        <li>
          Notify the Contractor about your request and any booked appointment
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Your mobile phone number is used to send you SMS text messages related to
        your service request.
      </p>

      <h2>3. SMS / Text Messaging</h2>
      <p>
        By submitting a Contractor’s contact form with your mobile number, you
        consent to receive SMS text messages from us (acting as the Contractor’s
        assistant) regarding your request.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Message frequency varies based on your conversation.</li>
        <li>Message and data rates may apply.</li>
        <li>
          Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any message to opt out and stop receiving
          texts.
        </li>
        <li>
          Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for help, or contact us at
          <a href="mailto:levi@leadanswered.com">levi@leadanswered.com</a>.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Data Sharing</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Customer data is not shared with 3rd parties for promotional or
          marketing purposes.
        </li>
        <li>
          Mobile opt-in and consent are never shared with anyone for any purpose.
          Any information sharing that may be mentioned elsewhere in this policy
          excludes mobile opt-in data.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Lead Answered Messaging Terms and Conditions</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>
          The messaging program consists of conversational, customer care, and
          informational one-to-one messages, including answering questions,
          providing support, account setup and onboarding, scheduling, confirming
          service details, appointments, and trial follow-up.
        </li>
        <li>
          You can cancel the SMS service at any time by texting STOP to the number
          from which you received messages. We will send a confirmation that you
          have been unsubscribed, after which you will receive no further
          messages. To rejoin, sign up again as you did initially.
        </li>
        <li>If you experience issues, reply HELP or email levi@leadanswered.com.</li>
        <li>Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</li>
        <li>
          Message and data rates may apply. Message frequency varies based on
          communication needs. Contact your wireless provider with questions about
          your plan.
        </li>
        <li>For privacy questions, see our Privacy Policy above.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2>4. How We Share Information — and What We Never Share</h2>
      <p>
        We share the information you provide with the Contractor you contacted, so
        they can serve your request. We may also use service providers (such as
        our SMS provider) solely to operate the service on our behalf.
      </p>
      <p>
        We do not sell your personal information, and we do not share your phone
        number or personal data with third parties for their own marketing
        purposes.
      </p>
      <div
        class="not-prose my-6 rounded-xl border border-black/[0.08] bg-paper-100 p-4 text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-700"
      >
        <strong class="text-ink-900">Mobile opt-in and consent.</strong> No mobile
        information — including your phone number and your consent to receive text
        messages — will be shared with, sold to, or rented to any third parties or
        affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes.
        <strong class="text-ink-900"
          >Text-messaging opt-in data and consent are never shared with any third
          parties.</strong
        >
      </div>

      <h2>5. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>
        We retain your information for as long as needed to provide the service
        and to meet legal or recordkeeping requirements, after which we delete or
        anonymize it.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Data Security</h2>
      <p>
        We maintain administrative, technical, and physical safeguards to protect
        personal information from unauthorized access, use, or disclosure, and we
        restrict access to authorized personnel only.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Your Choices</h2>
      <p>
        You can opt out of text messages at any time by replying
        <strong>STOP</strong>. You may also contact us at
        <a href="mailto:levi@leadanswered.com">levi@leadanswered.com</a> to ask
        about, correct, or request deletion of your information.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Children’s Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Our service is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly
        collect personal information from them.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The “Last updated”
        date above reflects the most recent version.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        Lead Answered (a service of Grovebox LLC)<br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:levi@leadanswered.com">levi@leadanswered.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>
